  "reasoning": "*   Role: Content Policy Analyst.\n    *   Context: \"Friends\" app (User pays, Expert is paid host).\n    *   Goal: Find violations in three categories: `PlatformMove`, `SuspiciousActivity`, `Explicit-Flirting`.\n    *   Output: Minified JSON object.\n    *   Constraints:\n        *   `PlatformMove`: Proposing external contact, phone numbers, IDs, meeting in person.\n        *   `SuspiciousActivity`: Money/payment for sexual content/services.\n        *   `Explicit-Flirting`: Sexual talk, nudity requests, sexual acts.\n        *   \"About a Violation\": Warnings, stories, refusals, hypotheticals (violation: \"no\", confidence <= 0.3).\n        *   Allowed: Internal call types, \"normal talk\", non-contact app mentions, general personal details, compliments, \"I love you\", refusals of sexual talk.\n\n    *   [00:00] Hello. (Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [00:02] Hi. (Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [00:04] Hello, how are you? (Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [00:07] How are you? Show your face and talk. (Request to show face - Is this Explicit-Flirting? The policy says \"Show\" or \"open\" when it is about the body or the video. However, \"Show your face\" is generally considered ordinary conversation/introduction unless it's sexual. In this context, it's just asking to see the person. Not explicit nudity/sexual act.)\n    *   [00:12] Your face is not visible. (Observation - Allowed)\n    *   [00:15] You are wearing a mask, remove the mask and talk. (Request to remove mask - Not sexual, just wanting to see the face. Allowed.)\n    *   [00:19] No. Which area are you from? (Refusal to remove mask, personal detail question - Allowed)\n    *   [00:21] Bijapur. (Personal detail - Allowed)\n    *   [00:23] Bijapur, okay. Did you have your meal? (Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [00:26] Yes, what about you? Where are you from? (Small talk - Allowed)\n    *   [00:29] Bangalore. (Personal detail - Allowed)\n    *   [00:31] Why are you talking like a stranger? (Ordinary conversation - Allowed)\n    *   [00:36] Where are you from? Where are you from? (Personal detail - Allowed)\n    *   [00:37] Bangalore. Can you hear me? (Personal detail, call quality - Allowed)\n    *   [00:39] Mask, mask, you are not removing the mask, are you? (Observation - Allowed)\n    *   [00:41] No. (Refusal - Allowed)\n    *   [00:44] Will you show it? (Referring to the face/removing the mask. Not sexual. Allowed.)\n    *   [00:46] No. How long have you been using this? (Refusal, general question - Allowed)\n    *   [00:49] Why are you asking? You are wearing a mask. (Ordinary conversation - Allowed)\n    *   [00:52] Just like that. (Ordinary conversation - Allowed)\n\n    *   `PlatformMove`: No mention of WhatsApp, Telegram, phone numbers, IDs, or meeting in person.\n    *   `SuspiciousActivity`: No mention of money, rates, or payments for services.\n    *   `Explicit-Flirting`: No sexual talk, no requests for nudity (asking to see a face/remove a mask is not nudity/sexual act), no sexual preferences.\n\n    *   The conversation is entirely ordinary small talk and requests to see the other person's face (which is allowed).\n    *   No violations found.",
